# two_million_keys_are_set_and_found
is! 'm = {}; for i in 0..2000000 { m["k\\(i)"] = i }; s = 0; for i in 0..2000000 { s += m["k\\(i)"] }; s + count(m)' (1999999000000 + 2000000)

# keys_and_values_of_a_big_map
